22:["$","section","Make every image explain something",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-heading font-semibold text-ink","children":"Make every image explain something"}],[["$","p","A large opening image establishes an impression, but a navigation detail or mobile view can explain a decision. Choose images for the story they tell, not just for how attractive they look together.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"A large opening image establishes an impression, but a navigation detail or mobile view can explain a decision. Choose images for the story they tell, not just for how attractive they look together."}],["$","p","Use a caption to explain what readers should notice. Alt text should describe meaningful content without a string of SEO keywords. Never publish private information from dashboards, analytics or client messages.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"Use a caption to explain what readers should notice. Alt text should describe meaningful content without a string of SEO keywords. Never publish private information from dashboards, analytics or client messages."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Opening image: the overall visual direction.",{"children":"Opening image: the overall visual direction."}],["$","li","Detail: a content or navigation decision.",{"children":"Detail: a content or navigation decision."}],["$","li","Mobile view: how the same task works on a phone.",{"children":"Mobile view: how the same task works on a phone."}]]}],"$undefined"]}]
23:["$","section","Separate evidence from expectations",{"id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-heading font-semibold text-ink","children":"Separate evidence from expectations"}],[["$","p","‘A clearer path to registration’ describes design intent. ‘Registrations increased’ is a behavioural claim that needs data. If publishing a metric, include the period, source and context affecting the comparison.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"‘A clearer path to registration’ describes design intent. ‘Registrations increased’ is a behavioural claim that needs data. If publishing a metric, include the period, source and context affecting the comparison."}],["$","p","Without those data, publish the scope and verifiable features. Precision is not weaker selling: it helps clients understand what they actually receive. Client quotes also need to be authentic and approved.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"Without those data, publish the scope and verifiable features. Precision is not weaker selling: it helps clients understand what they actually receive. Client quotes also need to be authentic and approved."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
24:["$","section","Finish with a connected next step",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-heading font-semibold text-ink","children":"Finish with a connected next step"}],[["$","p","After the story, link to a relevant service, similar project or contact. Link text should explain the destination. ‘Explore web design services’ provides more context than ‘Click here’.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"After the story, link to a relevant service, similar project or contact. Link text should explain the destination. ‘Explore web design services’ provides more context than ‘Click here’."}],["$","p","For search and AI readability, put important information in text, not only in images. A project title, a short answer about what was delivered and clearly organised sections make the page easier to understand. Structured data should describe that same visible content, not add nonexistent awards or ratings.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"For search and AI readability, put important information in text, not only in images. A project title, a short answer about what was delivered and clearly organised sections make the page easier to understand. Structured data should describe that same visible content, not add nonexistent awards or ratings."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
